// An 'is' entry that is no name ('[DeserializeMark]') is refused where it is read. The enum's supplied
// 'serialize', 'deserialize', '==' and 'hash' are then looked for among its 'is' entries, and an entry with
// no name is not one of them.

mod enum_is_unreadable_entry;

enum Mark is Serialize, [DeserializeMark] { Low, Mid, High }  //~ ErrorNoVar
